  "invariants": [
    "Reissue requires VoidConfirmed, verified recipient eligibility and destination, and a linked replacement chain",
    "A voided check's funds are never silently released to the fund: the escheat disposition is recorded first",
    "Every Outstanding check is rescreened on every sanctions list update before its next transition",
    "Each state has a defined grant, reservation and ledger effect; the outstanding-check liability is cleared exactly once",
    "Aging thresholds are configuration owned by the Controller, never hard-coded"
  ]
